    "name": "Moog Sound Studio\n\nAccessory Kit",
    "description": "Synthesizers\nAccessories\nSoftware Store\nThe Wave\nSupport\nSynthesizers\nAccessories\nSoftware Store\nThe Wave\nSupport\nFeatured Products\nMessenger\nSYNTHESIZERS\n\nA New Method Of Sonic Experimentation, Communication, And Connection Has Arrived\n\nDISCOVER\n\nLabyrinth\nSYNTHESIZERS\n\nHow Deep Does The Rabbit Hole Go? Meet Labyrinth, An Idea Machine That Aims To Answer That Very Question.\n\nDISCOVER\n\nGet The Latest Moog News\n\nThis site is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google\nPrivacy Policy and Terms of Service apply.\n\nHome\n\n/\n\nAccessories\n\n/\n\nMoog Sound Studio Accessory Kit\n\nMoog Sound Studio\n\nAccessory Kit\n\nFind a Dealer\n\nComprehensive Connectivity\n\nThe Moog Sound Studio Accessory Kit is the 3-tier rack solution your Mother Ecosystem synths have been waiting for.\n\nEasily Expand Your Setup\n\nMount any combination of Mother-32, DFAM, Subharmonicon, Spectravox, and Labyrinth semi-modular synths together vertically for maximum modularity and synthesis possibilities. \n\nEach Moog Sound Studio Accessory Kit includes a compact summing mixer with three-way power distribution to provide flexible signal routing and power your entire system conveniently from a single power supply. Also included is a patch cable organizer, dust cover, and of course, all the cables needed to connect your instruments together.\n\nWhat’s in the box?\n\nPersonal Stereo Summing Mixer and Instrument Cables\n\nThis four-input analog summing mixer features selectable mono or stereo configurations for versatile routing options, and the built-in three-way power distribution hub supplies power for up to three 60HP instruments conveniently from a single source. The included instrument cables come in lengths and colors to complement the system and reduce clutter. The 1/8” output with a built-in level control allows you to connect headphones, an audio interface, or monitor speakers.\n\nWhat’s in the box?\n\nThree-Tier Rack Kit\n\nConveniently stack all three synthesizers* and summing mixer together as one connected system to maximize studio space and orient instruments vertically for optimal interconnectivity.  Designed for both stability and style, the rack not only optimizes your space but also creates an ergonomic setup that makes for easy access to all controls and patch points.\n\n*synthesizers not included\n\nWhat’s in the box?\n\nCable Organizer and Custom Patch Cable Set\n\nThe included patch cable organizer connects to the three-tier rack, keeping patch cables neat and orderly for a hassle-free workflow. A custom set of patch cables have been selected in lengths and quantities to maximize system patchability.\n\nWhat’s in the box?\n\nProtective Dust Cover\n\nProtect your instruments when not in use. This water repellant cover is made from rugged Ballistic Cordura to safeguard your gear from dust, spills, and other studio (and stage) mishaps, while the ultra-soft interior remains gentle against your synth. Custom-fit with room to accommodate patch cabling and rear I/O panel access. Adjustable Velcro straps ensure your cover fits snug and stays in place.\n\nFeatured Products\n\nMother-32\nSYNTHESIZERS\nMother-32 is an intuitive and expandable semi-modular synthesizer that adds raw analog sound, powerful sequencing and extensive interconnectivity to any creative, electronic or modular ecosystem.\n\nDISCOVER\n\nSubharmonicon\nSYNTHESIZERS\nSubharmonicon is a versatile analog labyrinth of subharmonically derived synthesis and polyrhythmic sound, equally suited for losing oneself and simultaneously finding oneself.\n\nDISCOVER\n\nSynthesizers\n\nDISCOVER\n\nAccessories\n\nDISCOVER\n\nSoftware Store\n\nSHOP SOFTWARE\n\nSupport\nForum\nHelpdesk\nKnowledge base\nDownloads\nAll Product Downloads\nPresets\nUser Manuals\nPatches\nFirmware Updates\nThe Wave\nView all articles\nRSS Feed\nAbout Us\nCareers\nTerms Of Use\nPrivacy\nFind A Dealer\nGet The Latest Moog News\n\nThis site is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google\nPrivacy Policy and Terms of Service apply.",
